# game/data/world_events/global_shared/VizuraCaravan/Scr_FirstMeetNTalk.rpy:5
translate de vizura_caravan_firstmeet_a3506427:

    # "The strange caravan in front of me rocked and shook, with what sounded like inhuman chattering inside of it with at least a dozen voices."
    "Die seltsame Karawane vor mir schwankte und bebte, und drinnen hörte man ein unmenschliches Geschnatter, das nach mindestens einem Dutzend Stimmen klang."

# game/data/world_events/global_shared/VizuraCaravan/Scr_FirstMeetNTalk.rpy:6
translate de vizura_caravan_firstmeet_bbbf5cfe:

    # "As the front door of the caravan swung open, a curvy, short, green-skinned girl stepped outside and smiled brightly towards me with her sharp, brilliant teeth."
